      "instance_name": "baker_holding_bread",
      "label": "Baker holding tray of bread in bakery",
      "description": "A baker is positioned centrally in the scene, holding a tray of freshly baked bread. She is surrounded by shelves of baked goods and an oven, indicating a bakery setting. The scene is framed to emphasize her as the central figure, with text overlays contrasting 'socialism' and 'capitalism' using the bread as a metaphor.",
