      "label": "Bread as Metaphor",
      "description": "In the meme, bread is used as a metaphor for basic necessities or goods in an economy. This requires understanding that bread is a common symbol for sustenance and economic well-being, which is a real-world cultural and symbolic reference not visible in the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
