      "instance_name": "calm_confidence",
      "label": "calm and confident expression",
      "description": "The baker has a composed, slightly smiling facial expression, looking directly at the viewer with a neutral to positive demeanor, suggesting self-assurance and contentment in her work. Her posture and the way she holds the tray of bread reinforce this calm confidence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
